# Coryn Club Crawler

A polite, resumable Python crawler for Coryn Club structured data and item images, with a **self-contained offline dataset builder**.

It collects:

- items and complete item stats
- monsters, bosses / mini-bosses, difficulties and drops
- maps and map → monster relationships
- item images from public item pages
- image checksums, file sizes, dimensions and timestamps
- normalized CSV tables
- consolidated raw JSONL API responses
- a portable offline folder / optional ZIP that does not require Coryn to remain online

## Project layout

```text
coryn-crawler/
├── .env.example
